  77:../../../../..//Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_crc_ex.c ****   * @param  Pol CRC generating polynomial (7, 8, 16 or 32-bit long).
  78:../../../../..//Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_crc_ex.c ****   *         This parameter is written in normal representation, e.g.
  79:../../../../..//Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_crc_ex.c ****   *         @arg for a polynomial of degree 7, X^7 + X^6 + X^5 + X^2 + 1 is written 0x65
