  82:../../../../..//Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_crc_ex.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
  83:../../../../..//Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_crc_ex.c ****   *          @arg @ref CRC_POLYLENGTH_7B  7-bit long CRC (generating polynomial of degree 7)
  84:../../../../..//Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_crc_ex.c ****   *          @arg @ref CRC_POLYLENGTH_8B  8-bit long CRC (generating polynomial of degree 8)
  85:../../../../..//Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_crc_ex.c ****   *          @arg @ref CRC_POLYLENGTH_16B 16-bit long CRC (generating polynomial of degree 16)
